# Google Santa Tracker (2015-2019 Mobile Archive)

An archival and preservation project for the final official Android release of Google Santa Tracker (December 2023). 

Following the delisting and discontinuation of the native Santa Tracker app on the Google Play Store, this repository preserves the standalone Android build along with setup instructions for modern devices and desktop emulators.

---

## 📌 About This Project

Between 2015 and 2019, Google maintained active native Android builds of Santa Tracker before shifting focus entirely to web-based experiences. Following the delisting and discontinuation of the native app on the Google Play Store, this repository preserves the standalone legacy APKs alongside instructions on how to run them locally.

### 🌟 Key Features (2015 & 2019 Builds)
* **Client-Rendered Mini-Games:** Native offline gameplay including *Present Drop*, *Rocket Sleigh*, *Wrap Battle*, and 2015's tilt-based *Gumball*.
* **Preserved Engine Assets:** Original uncompressed audio soundbanks, vector graphics, and high-density sprite sheets built specifically for the Android runtime.
* **Legacy Compatibility:** Full support for physical Android devices as well as modern desktop emulators with virtual sensor mapping.

### Key Features of the 2019 Build
* **Native Offline Mini-Games:** Includes client-rendered favorites like *Present Drop*, *Rocket Sleigh*, and *Wrap Battle*.
* **Dedicated Engine Assets:** Localized sound banks, sprite sheets, and animations built specifically for Android runtimes.
* **Preserved Village Map:** The final structural layout released prior to full web-only migration.

